  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a project proposal to facilitate market access through enhancing phytosanitary capacity in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the PPG will be to develop a proposal for a project to strengthen Uzbekistan&apos;s phytosanitary capacity, enabling the country&apos;s agricultural products to meet international standards and facilitate market access, especially in high-demand export markets. The findings of the PCE will form the basis for work under this PPG</narrative>
